{"3397470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BORZOI", "steam_appid": 3397470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BORZOI</strong> is a first-person survival horror game where you are relentlessly hunted by a giant, demonic Borzoi dog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a park ranger assigned to Foster Park, a once-peaceful nature reserve turned nightmare. Tasked with locating a missing colleague, you quickly realize the park harbors dark secrets. As you explore its eerie trails and abandoned sites, the horrifying truth behind its cursed history comes to light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397470/extras/5feffbbefc6f55a2201427b47d11e616.poster.avif?t=1774455181\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397470/extras/5feffbbefc6f55a2201427b47d11e616.webm?t=1774455181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397470/extras/5feffbbefc6f55a2201427b47d11e616.mp4?t=1774455181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RISING DREAD</strong><br>Armed with only your wits, a flickering flashlight, and scarce resources, every decision matters as you navigate the dangers of Foster Park. Hunted by the relentless BORZOI and its reanimated minions, every sound and move you make could spell your doom. Survival demands careful strategy and quick thinking—actions have consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397470/extras/367631604decd762106127396ba02b6a.poster.avif?t=1774455181\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397470/extras/367631604decd762106127396ba02b6a.webm?t=1774455181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397470/extras/367631604decd762106127396ba02b6a.mp4?t=1774455181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ESCAPING THE HORROR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your path through a semi-open world filled with deadly secrets and dangers. Solve environmental puzzles, scavenge for resources, and uncover the twisted history of a cult that left behind unimaginable horrors. The deeper you delve, the closer you come to understanding the terror haunting Foster Park.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397470/extras/e09c44c3d3e97896bbb4f008896c812f.poster.avif?t=1774455181\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397470/extras/e09c44c3d3e97896bbb4f008896c812f.webm?t=1774455181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397470/extras/e09c44c3d3e97896bbb4f008896c812f.mp4?t=1774455181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A relentless, unkillable predator</strong> that reacts to sound, light, and your habits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive survival loop:</strong> sneak, hide, run—or <strong>craft</strong> what you need to barely get by.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-stakes environmental puzzles</strong> rooted in the park’s chilling lore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Semi-open world</strong> with multiple routes, secrets, and systems that interlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep lore</strong> scattered through found notes, locations, and events that change as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong> based on what you discover, who you save, and what you dare to try.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BORZOI</strong> is a first-person survival horror game where you are relentlessly hunted by a giant, demonic Borzoi dog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a park ranger assigned to Foster Park, a once-peaceful nature reserve turned nightmare. Tasked with locating a missing colleague, you quickly realize the park harbors dark secrets. As you explore its eerie trails and abandoned sites, the horrifying truth behind its cursed history comes to light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397470/extras/5feffbbefc6f55a2201427b47d11e616.poster.avif?t=1774455181\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397470/extras/5feffbbefc6f55a2201427b47d11e616.webm?t=1774455181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397470/extras/5feffbbefc6f55a2201427b47d11e616.mp4?t=1774455181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RISING DREAD</strong><br>Armed with only your wits, a flickering flashlight, and scarce resources, every decision matters as you navigate the dangers of Foster Park. Hunted by the relentless BORZOI and its reanimated minions, every sound and move you make could spell your doom. Survival demands careful strategy and quick thinking—actions have consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397470/extras/367631604decd762106127396ba02b6a.poster.avif?t=1774455181\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397470/extras/367631604decd762106127396ba02b6a.webm?t=1774455181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397470/extras/367631604decd762106127396ba02b6a.mp4?t=1774455181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ESCAPING THE HORROR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your path through a semi-open world filled with deadly secrets and dangers. Solve environmental puzzles, scavenge for resources, and uncover the twisted history of a cult that left behind unimaginable horrors. The deeper you delve, the closer you come to understanding the terror haunting Foster Park.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397470/extras/e09c44c3d3e97896bbb4f008896c812f.poster.avif?t=1774455181\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397470/extras/e09c44c3d3e97896bbb4f008896c812f.webm?t=1774455181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397470/extras/e09c44c3d3e97896bbb4f008896c812f.mp4?t=1774455181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A relentless, unkillable predator</strong> that reacts to sound, light, and your habits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive survival loop:</strong> sneak, hide, run—or <strong>craft</strong> what you need to barely get by.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-stakes environmental puzzles</strong> rooted in the park’s chilling lore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Semi-open world</strong> with multiple routes, secrets, and systems that interlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep lore</strong> scattered through found notes, locations, and events that change as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong> based on what you discover, who you save, and what you dare to try.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "BORZOI is a first-person survival horror game where you are relentlessly hunted by a giant, demonic Borzoi dog. Experience high tension as you fight for survival, solve high-stakes puzzles, and uncover the dark legacy of a twisted cult—all while evading a predator that cannot be tamed", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397470/header.jpg?t=1774455181", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397470/1993ad2c7de59e671f3363542f2d9351035b570d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774455181", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397470/1993ad2c7de59e671f3363542f2d9351035b570d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774455181", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 / 8 / 10, 64-bits<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i3 / AMD FX 2.4Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 460 / AMD Radeon HD 5750 / Intel HD 630<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommende